---
// Services section with 4-column grid and lime icons
---

<section id="services" class="py-6 md:py-18 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-2 mb-3">
        limemedia.co.za, managed by LIME HOLDINGS (Pty) Ltd, based in Cape Town, South Africa, is committed to protecting the privacy of our online visitors in compliance with the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA) and other relevant privacy laws. This privacy policy explains how we use and protect the personal data collected from you.
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        1. Data Collection and Purpose:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        We collect personal identification information (Name, email address, phone number, ID number, and optionally your income bracket) for the following purposes:
      </p>

      <div class="block ml-4">
        <ul class="list-disc text-[15px] md:text-[20px] mt-4 ml-8 font-normal text-foreground">
          <li>To process your orders/services and manage your account.</li>
          <li>To offer you tailored promotions and special offers.</li>
          <li>To enhance your website experience.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        2. Consent and Data Sharing:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        We will share your data with our partner companies to offer you related products and services.
      </p>     
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        3. Data Subject Rights:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        You have rights including access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, objection to processing, and data portability. Requests can be made to info@limemedia.co.za, and we will respond within one month.
      </p>     
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        4. Data Security and Retention:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        Your data is retained until you unsubscribe from our mailing list. We implement robust security measures to prevent unauthorized access or loss of data.
      </p>     
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        5. Cross-Border Data Transfer:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        If we transfer data outside South Africa, we ensure compliance with POPIA’s cross-border transfer conditions.
      </p>     
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        6. Third-Party Websites:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        Our privacy policy applies only to our website. Links to other websites have their own privacy policies.
      </p>     
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        7. Cookie Policy:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        We use cookies to improve your experience. Our detailed cookie policy is available on our website.
      </p>     
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        8. Child Privacy:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        We take extra care in protecting the privacy of users under the age of 18. Our services are not intentionally targeted at children, and we do not knowingly collect information from them.
      </p>     
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        9. Changes to Our Privacy Policy:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        Our privacy policy is regularly reviewed and updated on our website.
      </p>     
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        10. Contact Information:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        For any queries or to exercise your data protection rights, please email us at info@limemedia.co.za.
      </p>   
      
      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-bold text-foreground mt-8">
        11. Complaints:
      </p>

      <p class="text-[15px] md:text-[20px] font-normal text-foreground mt-4">
        If you have a complaint, contact us directly or reach out to the Information Commissioner’s Office at inforeg@justice.gov.za or 010 023 5200.
      </p>           
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

